<title>USA: Florida First holders OK reorganization.</title>
<headline>Florida First holders OK reorganization.</headline>
<dateline>PANAMA CITY, Fla. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida First Bancorp Inc said on Monday its stockholders voted to approve the agreement and plan of reorganization between it and proposed acquiror Regions Financial Corp.</p>
<p>In May, Regions said it agreed to acquire Florida First for about $40 million or $11.65 per share.</p>
<p>The deal was expected to close or about January 24, the company said.</p>
